    <img src="/images/SAGEAnomalyUnderNorthBay.gif" alt="SAGE Anomaly — visualization of the underground facility" />
    <figcaption>Underground visualization — the anomaly as processed by GAN + oscilloscope art</figcaption>
  </figure>

